# simplify_topology.dict
#
# libFuzzer's recommended dictionary for the `simplify_topology` target, converted
# from libFuzzer's printed form (C octal escapes)
# to the dictionary file form, which reads only \\, \" and \xNN
# escapes. Each entry's use count is on the comment line above it, in
# libFuzzer's order.
#
#   cargo +nightly fuzz run simplify_topology -- -dict=dict/simplify_topology.dict

